+\subsection{Completed smoke-pilot setup}\label{sec:pilot-setup}
+The development smoke pilot ran on 11 November 2026 using the history-page status-filter task, identified as DEV-HISTORY-STATUS-01. Four fresh sessions covered the four conditions once each. Every session requested GPT-6 Luna (\texttt{gpt-6-luna}), High reasoning, and Standard speed by default through Codex CLI 0.166.0. Wall time ran from CLI invocation to completion, with a 900-second cap. No token cap was specified for this smoke test. The configuration is a development setting, and the model alias does not certify immutable backend weights.
