+Each session ran in a fresh unprivileged container with its own PostgreSQL database and no host research mounts, Docker socket, or prior repository history. The common image used Node 24, pnpm 11.7.0, and dependencies from the same lockfile. The application was started before model timing began. Final patches were captured and evaluated in clean containers without agent credentials. Seed 20261111 fixed the serial order S0V0, S1V0, S0V1, S1V1 before model execution. The protocol and manifests retain the allocation, environment identifiers, and isolation checks.
